PrbCQXEEcZ-UAQIassUF5u7rqJfWIbLtpaRah14Fw&oe=69BBE7EA"}, {"file_name": "XR Anatomy - Screenshot 5.png", "id": "1395609431053072", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974570_1395609434386405_1110856654319363664_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sND8kUkfpvAQ7kNvwGFNpQl&_nc_oc=AdnEOQzpok9h3m3eJi1KHoU9QWuaqw0a-lnHRgS6X7_fca3PJOWy0dIS0g6FFt9Lrm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwqiyuvT2WLJX8oxp_S_CvUFkJKs7gnldWxdwz_aPxHGg&oe=69BBEC20"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "XR Anatomy - Screenshot 3.png", "id": "735343688567844", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974828_735343691901177_4338889197309424732_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y0TXemf3li0Q7kNvwERbZqf&_nc_oc=Adm-PKUNQCpAj3YCzWVr3qK8uEHY1CdBVLmLpLtpcOhRyrTopDxozprSlCxnMmdbDOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwo50g7MIrqjjTojmJgNleMH-39C_h7aLeFrAZtG0xWSA&oe=69BBE781"}, "display_name": "XR Anatomy", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dive into a world where learning about the human body isn't just reading from a textbook. Our interactive features let you get hands-on, allowing you to twist, turn, and zoom in on lifelike mixed reality models. It's all about getting a real feel for what's under the skin, making complex anatomy easy to understand and remember.\n\nOur 3D models aren't just thrown together; they're the result of intense dedication, crafted with precision to get every detail just right. We've poured over every source we could get our hands on\u2014top-notch books, CT, and 3D scans\u2014to make sure what you're studying is as close to the real thing as possible. It's like having a virtual cadaver at your fingertips, minus the mess.", "short_description": "Dive into a world where learning about the human body isn't just reading from a textbook. Our interactive features let you get hands-on, allowing you to twist, turn, and zoom in on 